  message: "WI-nopam (PR #1317) did this item's MOVE half: function_summaries/go_testify_zap.yaml, python_django.yaml, rust_aes_gcm_serde_json.yaml and library_signatures/python-django.yaml declare provenance: community. Their loaders already rank community below built-in (a community row takes a key only when no built-in row holds it). Remaining here: withholding the CLEANING effect -- a community terminating summary (testify x4) must not end a branch; a community library signature's receiver typing to be measured and withheld if it can clean a verdict. python.yaml's stale comment about django rows went with the move."  # 972e
